binaries)` in a temp dir (tempfile? not in deps — genesis-vibes depends on tempfile but we can't use its dep directly. Add tempfile to evallerina deps? Or use std::env::temp_dir + unique name). Check if evallerina already uses tempfile in dev-deps.\\n\\nActually, could avoid a temp dir: invoke wai init in the generation dir = a temp dir we create. Let me check Cargo.toml dev-deps and whether tempfile is used anywhere.\",\"format\":\"unknown\",\"index\":0}]"},{"type":"toolCall","id":"chatcmpl-tool-9b8b795eb245bb81","name":"bash","arguments":{"command":"grep -n \"tempfile\\|dev-dependencies\" -r Cargo.toml src tests | head; grep -rn \"temp_dir\\|tempdir\\|TempDir\" src tests | head","timeout":10}}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"openrouter","model":"z-ai/glm-5.3-flash","usage":{"input":28393,"output":1502,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"reasoning":1445,"totalTokens":29895,"cost":{"input":0.00425895,"output":0.0007509999999999999,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.00500995}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1792433058920,"responseId":"gen-1792433058-iRvlmb6bL2PZvBOeCQ8U","rawStopReason":"tool_calls"}}
